    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that all three new templates are live for every customer by Friday 2026-10-30 at 17:00 UK time because the 2 November campaign links to them. No unresolved items were listed, while remarks about finance wording, end-of-month timing, old templates and the referral block remained as stated only.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed by Hannah, Tomasz and Aiko, with recheck passed, that all three new templates are live for every customer by Friday 2026-10-30 at 17:00 UK time because the 2 November campaign links to them.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- It was stated that finance still owes the wording for reverse charge invoices.\n- It was stated that finance will be chased today.\n- It was stated as a suggestion to aim for end of month for the full switch-over.\n- It was stated in response that end of month was OK and would be planned around.\n- It was stated that end of month should be doable if finance gets back this week.\n- It was stated as a request to turn off the old templates once the switch is done so both are not sent.\n- It was stated that they will be deleted from the sender config after a day of clean sends.\n- It was stated as a request for a preview link for the referral block.\n- It was stated that one will be sent this afternoon.\n- It was stated that the referral wording cannot be changed after this week.\n- It was stated as a suggestion to keep that wording frozen."
